# Runtime identity and private overlay/RPC/node configuration. Keep the broad
# patterns: the application intentionally creates timestamped migration and
# rollback copies that must never be staged with `git add -A`.
identity.key*
proxy.json*
peers.json*
zerohour.conf*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.bak
!release/update-public.pem

